{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011308001:0":{"text":"여러분, 이곳은 달빛호수 마을의 보물창고, 이비스 약초가든입니다!","source_cn":"向各位隆重介绍，这就是月湖村的藏宝地——叶维斯草药园！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1AA93E48E6E87A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011308002:0":{"text":"저의 위대한 발명품들 중 절반... 아니, 3분의 2인가? 아무튼, 발명품에 쓰이는 재료는 다 여기서 온 거예요!","source_cn":"我重大发明里五成……还是是七成的原料来着？都来自这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F48B3E4EFA1618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011308003:0":{"text":"콜린 아저씨에게 새로운 팔을 만들어 드릴 재료를 찾으려면 우선 가든의 주인인 딘 아저씨께 말씀드려야 해요.","source_cn":"要给科林大叔的新手臂找材料，得先和园主迪恩叔叔说一声才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45419D565534C42F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:达米安":{"text":"다미안","source":"达米安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}